  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the fondue pot over medium heat and add the infused oil.",
    "Sauté the lemon zest and smoked paprika for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the sardines and stir gently to coat with the oil and spices.",
    "Pour in the vegetable broth and bring the mixture to a gentle simmer.",
    "Stir in the Dijon and whole grain mustards, letting the sauce thicken for 3 minutes.",
    "Reduce the heat and sprinkle the grated cheddar cheese over the top, covering the pot.",
    "Cover and let the cheese melt for 2 minutes, then stir to distribute heat evenly.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley, season with salt and pepper, and serve hot directly from the fondue pot."
